/*  BOLUM 13/13: HARITALAR                                            */
/*  Harita oylamasi, Rock The Vote, sonraki harita, harita            */
/*  degisimi, harita ortam sesleri (ambient_generic geri yukleme).    */
/*  Bolum haritasi + kurallar: devtools/plugin/MODULES.md             */
